{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605231237303028a6e220f543db","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the project. Let me create the task list and start implementing M3. The key deliverables are:\n\n1. **DayCycle.ts** - Day cycle management with time phases\n2. **Lighting upgrade** - Day/night gradual lighting transitions (modify existing Lighting.ts)\n3. **UpgradeManager.ts** - 6 shop upgrades with purchase UI\n4. **DaySummary.ts** - Daily settlement with income/expense stats\n5. **SaveManager.ts** - Auto save + load restore\n\nWait, looking at the existing code more carefully:\n\n- DayCycle functionality is already partially in GameState.ts (getPhaseFromTime, timeOfDay tracking)\n- Lighting.ts exists but only does night rendering - needs day/night gradual transitions\n- EconomySystem already has upgrade purchasing logic\n- DaySummary data structure exists in GameState\n- Save/load exists in GameState.ts\n\nSo the M3 task is really about:\n\n1. Creating a proper DayCycle.ts that manages the full day loop with events\n2. Upgrading Lighting.ts to support day/night gradual transitions\n3. Creating an UpgradeManager.ts (or enhancing EconomySystem) with UI\n4. Creating DaySummary.ts for daily settlement display\n5. Creating SaveManager.ts for auto-save after day end\n\nLet me plan the implementation:\n\n1. **DayCycle.ts** - New file that manages the day loop, broadcasts phase change events, handles time speed\n2. **Lighting.ts** - Modify to support gradual day/night transitions with smooth interpolation\n3. **UpgradeManager.ts** - Already partially done in EconomySystem, create a proper manager with UI rendering\n4. **DaySummary.ts** - New file for daily settlement calculations and display\n5. **SaveManager.ts** - New file wrapping the existing save/load with auto-save triggers\n6. Update App.ts to integrate all new modules\n7. Update GameState.ts with new fields (upgrades in save data)\n8. Update version to 0.3.0\n\nLet me implement all of this.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8f5bde0-4da8-4c4a-9322-50945e66ead7","uuid":"71968f7d-f99f-4711-963a-2a64148861ec"}
